{"id":"a80c063491021827","group":"56","path":"56/56-lem-hw-bounded-rpo.md","title":"有界HW规则的RPO定向","display":"lem-hw-bounded-rpo — 有界HW规则的RPO定向","type":"lemma","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"lemma","label":"56-lem-hw-bounded-rpo","aliases":["56-lem-hw-bounded-rpo"],"display":"lem-hw-bounded-rpo — 有界HW规则的RPO定向","depends_on":["[[56-df-hw-bounded-reduction]]","[[56-df-recursive-path-order]]","[[56-thm-rpo-well-founded]]"],"source_section":"§8.4.4 Theorem 8.4.41 proof; §6.4 Theorem 6.4.3","source_printed_pages":"211,354","source_ocr_blocks":[232,375],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr; explicit-coding-local","source_proof_status":"read-and-reconstructed-in-note; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"label","html":"56-lem-hw-bounded-rpo"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-lem-hw-bounded-rpo</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-hw-bounded-rpo — 有界HW规则的RPO定向"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b8fede32032ab9e5\" href=\"?note=b8fede32032ab9e5\" title=\"56-df-hw-bounded-reduction\">56-df-hw-bounded-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"eafb5a2123c30027\" href=\"?note=eafb5a2123c30027\" title=\"56-df-recursive-path-order\">56-df-recursive-path-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"415b9e19f223c427\" href=\"?note=415b9e19f223c427\" title=\"56-thm-rpo-well-founded\">56-thm-rpo-well-founded</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§8.4.4 Theorem 8.4.41 proof; §6.4 Theorem 6.4.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"211,354"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>232</span><span>375</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr; explicit-coding-local"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"read-and-reconstructed-in-note; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b8fede32032ab9e5\" href=\"?note=b8fede32032ab9e5\" title=\"56-df-hw-bounded-reduction\">56-df-hw-bounded-reduction</a> 的记号。取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N,H\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(N,H\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\ge N+1\">\\(H\\ge N+1\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stat}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Stat}_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&gt;_{\\mathrm{rpo}}^{\\Sigma,V,\\succ,\\tau}\">\\(&gt;_{\\mathrm{rpo}}^{\\Sigma,V,\\succ,\\tau}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compatible},\\mathrm{RedOrd},\\mathrm{WF}\">\\(\\mathrm{Compatible},\\mathrm{RedOrd},\\mathrm{WF}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"eafb5a2123c30027\" href=\"?note=eafb5a2123c30027\" title=\"56-df-recursive-path-order\">56-df-recursive-path-order</a> 与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"415b9e19f223c427\" href=\"?note=415b9e19f223c427\" title=\"56-thm-rpo-well-founded\">56-thm-rpo-well-founded</a>；下式以截断签名、precedence及status实例化这些参数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathrm H}\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathrm H}\\)</span> 在下列有限层级子签名上取限制；status用上游的多重集编码0。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F^{\\mathrm H}_{\\le H}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf H(f,n)\\mid f\\in F,\\ 0\\le n\\le H\\},\\quad\n\\Sigma^{\\mathrm H}_{\\le H}\\coloneqq(F^{\\mathrm H}_{\\le H},\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathrm H}|_{F^{\\mathrm H}_{\\le H}}),\\quad\nT^{\\mathrm H}_{\\le H}\\coloneqq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma^{\\mathrm H}_{\\le H},V).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F^{\\mathrm H}_{\\le H}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf H(f,n)\\mid f\\in F,\\ 0\\le n\\le H\\},\\quad\n\\Sigma^{\\mathrm H}_{\\le H}\\coloneqq(F^{\\mathrm H}_{\\le H},\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathrm H}|_{F^{\\mathrm H}_{\\le H}}),\\quad\nT^{\\mathrm H}_{\\le H}\\coloneqq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma^{\\mathrm H}_{\\le H},V).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\succ_H\\coloneqq\\{(\\mathsf H(f,n),\\mathsf H(g,m))\\in(F^{\\mathrm H}_{\\le H})^2\\mid n&lt;m\\},\\qquad\n\\tau_H(c)\\coloneqq0\\quad(c\\in F^{\\mathrm H}_{\\le H}),\\qquad\n&gt;_H\\coloneqq&gt;_{\\mathrm{rpo}}^{\\Sigma^{\\mathrm H}_{\\le H},V,\\succ_H,\\tau_H}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\succ_H\\coloneqq\\{(\\mathsf H(f,n),\\mathsf H(g,m))\\in(F^{\\mathrm H}_{\\le H})^2\\mid n&lt;m\\},\\qquad\n\\tau_H(c)\\coloneqq0\\quad(c\\in F^{\\mathrm H}_{\\le H}),\\qquad\n&gt;_H\\coloneqq&gt;_{\\mathrm{rpo}}^{\\Sigma^{\\mathrm H}_{\\le H},V,\\succ_H,\\tau_H}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}(F^{\\mathrm H}_{\\le H},\\succ_H)\\land\n\\mathrm{RedOrd}_{\\Sigma^{\\mathrm H}_{\\le H},V}(&gt;_H)\\land\n\\mathrm{Compatible}(R^{\\mathrm H}_{R,N},&gt;_H).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{WF}(F^{\\mathrm H}_{\\le H},\\succ_H)\\land\n\\mathrm{RedOrd}_{\\Sigma^{\\mathrm H}_{\\le H},V}(&gt;_H)\\land\n\\mathrm{Compatible}(R^{\\mathrm H}_{R,N},&gt;_H).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\succ_H\">\\(\\succ_H\\)</span> 的下降链恰对应严格增加且不超过H的自然数层级，所以良基；这一步不能在未截断的所有自然数层级上直接声称良基。RPO良基定理遂给出约化序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&gt;_H\">\\(&gt;_H\\)</span>，即对替换、上下文封闭。</p>\n<p>设允许规则的左模式为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\hat l\">\\(\\hat l\\)</span>，最大层级为m≤N。其根的层级n≤m；右侧每个新函数符号的层级均为m+1，因此左根严格高于每个右函数根。右端出现的每个变量在非变量左端中出现，故是左项真子项，RPO子项分支给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\hat l&gt;_Hx\">\\(\\hat l&gt;_Hx\\)</span>。按右项结构归纳：变量情况已得；函数情况由每个子项已小于左项以及左根高于右根，应用precedence分支。得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\hat l&gt;_H\\hat r\">\\(\\hat l&gt;_H\\hat r\\)</span>，包括右端本身为变量的collapsing规则。两个规则侧的函数层级都≤N+1≤H，故确实属于该截断签名。</p>\n<p>这是Theorem 8.4.41的RPO证明逐项展开；没有假定有限原签名，也没有假定规则不复制变量。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-hw-bounded-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"b8fede32032ab9e5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-hw-bounded-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-recursive-path-order","status":"resolved","id":"eafb5a2123c30027","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-recursive-path-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-rpo-well-founded","status":"resolved","id":"415b9e19f223c427","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-rpo-well-founded]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-hw-bounded-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"b8fede32032ab9e5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-hw-bounded-reduction]] 的记号。取 $N,H\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $H\\ge N+1$。$\\mathrm{Stat}_n$、$>_{\\mathrm{rpo}}^{\\Sigma,V,\\succ,\\tau}$ 和 $\\mathrm{Compatible},\\mathrm{RedOrd},\\mathrm{WF}$ 见 [[56-df-recursive-path-order]] 与 [[56-thm-rpo-well-founded]]；下式以截断签名、precedence及status实例化这些参数。$\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathrm H}$ 在下列有限层级子签名上取限制；status用上游的多重集编码0。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-recursive-path-order","status":"resolved","id":"eafb5a2123c30027","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothe