H},V}(>_H)\\land\n\\mathrm{Compatible}(R^{\\mathrm H}_{R,N},>_H).","display":true},{"tex":"\\succ_H","display":false},{"tex":">_H","display":false},{"tex":"\\hat l","display":false},{"tex":"\\hat l>_Hx","display":false},{"tex":"\\hat l>_H\\hat r","display":false}],"bytes":2808,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-156","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-lem-hw-bounded-rpo.md]]"},{"id":"174d75d13166bebf","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-hw-bounded-reduction]] 的 $T^{\\mathrm H},R^{\\mathrm H}_{R,N},\\operatorname{InfHBound}_R$。$N\\in\\mathbb N$；约化序及其截断参数见 [[56-lem-hw-bounded-rpo]]。$\\to_{R^{\\mathrm H}_{R,N}}$ 为该规则子集在整个 $T^{\\mathrm H}$ 上的通常一步关系；$\\mathrm{WF}$ 沿归约方向排除无限链。"}],"outgoing":["b8fede32032ab9e5","eafb5a2123c30027","415b9e19f223c427"]}